# Build context filter for app/web/Dockerfile (context = this directory; the
# repository-root .dockerignore does not apply to it). Kept identical to
# app/auth-web/.dockerignore -- see that file's header for why `node_modules`,
# `dist` and `.env*` are load-bearing rather than merely size optimizations
# (they are what keeps the host working copy from overwriting the Dockerfile's
# own gated `bun install`, and keeps local credentials out of the build
# context).
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
.git
.gitignore
*.md
coverage
.vscode
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
